  <p id="c-liangshu-017-wangzhenguo-father:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-liangshu-017-wangzhenguo-father:p001:m0000" ref="m4d_lon_pyg_A">王珍國</persName>字<persName id="c-liangshu-017-wangzhenguo-father:p001:m0004" ref="m4d_lon_pyg_A">德重</persName>，沛國相人也。父<persName id="c-liangshu-017-wangzhenguo-father:p001:m0014" ref="m4d_lon_pyg">廣之</persName>，齊世良將，官至散騎常侍、車騎將軍。</p>
